WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:09.740
See tasks and approvals as cards by stage, move them along, and switch to the list, calendar and team views.

2
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:15.120
The board shows tasks and approvals as cards, one column per stage.

3
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:21.400
Filter by what to show, whose work it is, the priority or a label.

4
00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:30.180
Each card shows its reference, the amount or due date, and who has it. Overdue cards are marked in red.

5
00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:38.970
Drag a task to another column, or use the menu on its card.

6
00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:45.820
Move it to In progress. Everyone following the task sees the change.

7
00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:51.330
Approvals move by themselves as they are decided: open one to decide it.

8
00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:59.850
List shows the same work as a table, with filters by state, due date, label and dates.

9
00:00:59.860 --> 00:01:04.170
Calendar puts everything on its due date.

10
00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:11.150
Team shows what is on each person's plate, so work can be shared fairly.

11
00:01:11.150 --> 00:01:17.400
And Recurring creates the tasks that come back every week or month, by themselves.
